===persian===

پندار خاکم...
که مرا...
برگ‌های پاییزی پوشانده...
پیش از این که تن به دریا بسپاری،
در من غلطی بزن...
تا عطر پنجاه و پنج بهار،
بر پیکرت بنشیند...
آنک... تو را...
در ململی از خاطره می‌پیچم...
تو را، که...
به دورترین جزیرهٔ جهان سفر خواهی کرد...
انگار خاکم...
ای یار...
صندوقچه‌ای از مرا...
همراه بردار.
آذر ۱۳۷۳

===machine===

Think of me as earth...
earth that...
the autumn leaves have covered over...
Before you give your body to the sea,
take one roll in me...
so the scent of fifty-five springs
settles on your body...
There... I wrap you...
in a muslin of memory...
you, who...
will travel to the furthest island in the world...
Imagine I am earth...
O love...
take a small casket of me...
along with you.
Azar 1373

===lantern===

Think of me as earth —
earth the autumn leaves have covered over.
Before you give your body to the sea,
take one roll in me,
so the scent of fifty-five springs
settles on your body.
There — I wrap you
in a muslin of memory,
you who will travel
to the furthest island in the world.
Imagine I am earth.
O love,
take a small casket of me
along with you.

Azar 1373

===translation===

===footnotes===

Fifty-five springs is the poet's own age, and the only place in the book where he counts it
exactly: it puts his birth in ۱۳۱۸, 1939. Elsewhere he says 'sixty years' four times across sixteen
years, which is a way of saying *all my life* rather than a number.
